  "prompt": "Voltmarkt's checkout test AB-2025-01 assigned web shop customers to two variants, control and treatment. Show how each variant converted. A customer converted in a variant when the customer has a conversion in the test at or after the customer's assigned_at for that variant: a conversion before it does not count, and a customer who converted more than once counts once. A customer assigned to both variants counts in each of them. Return one row for each variant, including a variant with no conversions. Return four columns, in this order: variant; n_customers, the customers assigned to the variant; n_converted, those of them who converted; and conversion_rate_pct, 100 times n_converted divided by n_customers, rounded to 2 decimals. Sort by variant, alphabetically.",
